<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Heritage Marketing Studio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Epilogue:wght@500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper: #F7F5F1;
    --card: #FFFFFF;
    --ink: #17325E;
    --soft: #5B6472;
    --mute: #8B8578;
    --line: #DDD9D1;
    --line-soft: #EAE7E0;
    --orange: #F0561E;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,50,94,.05), 0 14px 34px -18px rgba(23,50,94,.16);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, .brandmark, .tier, .pc-t { font-family: 'Epilogue', sans-serif; }
  .mono { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .wrap { padding: 0 20px; } }

  /* ---------- header ---------- */
  header {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30;
    background: rgba(247,245,241,0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  header .bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 68px; gap: 20px; }
  .brandmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15.5px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .brandmark svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex: none; }
  nav.top { display: flex; gap: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
  nav.top a { padding: 8px 13px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; }
  nav.top a:hover { background: var(--card); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { nav.top { display: none; } }
  .hdr-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex: none; }
  .cta-btn {
    background: var(--ink); color: #F7F5F1; border: none; border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 10px 20px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; transition: transform .15s ease;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .signin-link { font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--soft); white-space: nowrap; }
  .signin-link:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero { padding: 72px 0 20px; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; } }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--mute); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .eyebrow .dot { display:inline-block; width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--orange); margin-right:9px; vertical-align:1px; }
  h1.display {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 50px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 20px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .lede { font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--soft); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 0 30px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-actions .ghost {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 9px 20px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; background: var(--card);
  }

  /* hero visual — layered producer-output collage, no stock photography, all drawn */
  .hero-visual { position: relative; height: 380px; }
  .hv-card {
    position: absolute; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); background: var(--card);
  }
  .hv-social { width: 190px; height: 240px; top: 6px; left: 18px; z-index: 3; }
  .hv-social .hv-top { height: 34px; background: var(--card); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
  .hv-social .hv-dot { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#17325E,#2E5EA6); flex: none; }
  .hv-social .hv-line { height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: var(--line-soft); }
  .hv-social .hv-body { height: 150px; background: linear-gradient(160deg,#EAF0F8,#DCE7F5); position: relative; }
  .hv-social .hv-body::after { content:''; position:absolute; inset:26px; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17325E,#2E5EA6); opacity:.14; }
  .hv-social .hv-foot { padding: 10px; display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .hv-pos {
    width: 150px; height: 190px; top: 130px; right: 6px; z-index: 2;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg,#FDEFE6,#FBDFC9); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .hv-pos .hv-tag { font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8A4A1E; }
  .hv-pos .hv-glyph { width:46px; height:46px; }
  .hv-onground {
    width: 168px; height: 108px; bottom: 10px; left: 60px; z-index: 4;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg,#E9F3EF,#D6EBE2); padding: 14px;
  }
  .hv-onground .hv-pin { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .hv-onground .hv-t { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #1E5C4A; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .hv-onground .hv-d { font-size: 10px; color: #2F6B54; line-height: 1.4; }
  .hv-video {
    width: 170px; height: 128px; top: 30px; right: 40px; z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg,#EFE7F5,#E2D3EF); padding: 12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .hv-video .hv-frames { display:flex; gap:4px; }
  .hv-video .hv-frames span { flex:1; height:38px; border-radius:5px; background:rgba(74,46,92,.16); }
  .hv-video .hv-t { font-size: 11px; font-weight:700; color:#4A2E5C; }

  /* ---------- marquee ---------- */
  .marquee-wrap { padding: 46px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: hidden; }
  .lane { display: flex; gap: 14px; width: max-content; }
  .lane + .lane { margin-top: 14px; }
  .lane.left { animation: scrollLeft 32s linear infinite; }
  .lane.right { animation: scrollRight 32s linear infinite; }
  .marquee-wrap:hover .lane { animation-play-state: paused; }
  @keyframes scrollLeft { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  @keyframes scrollRight { from { transform: translateX(-50%); } to { transform: translateX(0); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lane.left, .lane.right { animation: none; } }
  .chip {
    flex: none; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--soft); white-space: nowrap;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .chip .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); flex: none; }

  /* ---------- section shared ---------- */
  section { padding: 84px 0; scroll-margin-top: 84px; }
  .shead { max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
  .shead .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .shead h2 { font-size: clamp(26px, 3.2vw, 34px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 12px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .shead p { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--soft); margin: 0; }

  /* product diagram */
  .stages { display: flex; gap: 0; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .stage { flex: 1; min-width: 168px; position: relative; padding: 0 22px 0 0; }
  .stage:not(:last-child)::after { content: '→'; position: absolute; right: 2px; top: 0; color: var(--line); font-size: 16px; }
  .stage .sn { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .stage .st { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .stage .sd { font-size: 12px; color: var(--soft); line-height: 1.5; }
  .producers-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 14px; margin-top: 34px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .producers-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .producer { border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 18px; color: #fff; min-height: 118px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .producer .pc-t { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; }
  .producer .pc-d { font-size: 12px; opacity: .88; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 6px; }

  /* use cases — rich mockup grid */
  .uc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 18px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .uc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .uc-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .uc-visual { height: 140px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; }
  .uc-meta { padding: 16px 17px 18px; }
  .uc-meta .uc-tag { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .uc-meta h4 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; }
  .uc-meta p { margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--soft); line-height: 1.5; }
  .uc-note { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mute); }

  /* pricing */
  .price-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .price-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .price-card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .price-card .tier { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .price-card .who { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mute); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .price-card .amt { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .price-card .per { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .price-card .inc { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--soft); margin: 0; flex: 1; }
  .price-card .setup { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--mute); margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
  .price-quote { margin: 0 0 32px; padding: 16px 22px; border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); background: var(--card); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; max-width: 620px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .price-note { margin-top: 22px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--soft); max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.6; }

  /* demo */
  .demo-panel { background: var(--ink); border-radius: 22px; padding: 48px; color: #F7F5F1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .demo-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 36px 26px; } }
  .demo-panel h2 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(24px,3vw,32px); font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .demo-panel p.lede { color: #C9D6E8; max-width: none; }
  .demo-q { margin-top: 18px; padding: 16px 20px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); border-left: 3px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #E7EDF6; }
  .demo-form { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .demo-form label { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #A9B7CC; }
  .demo-form input, .demo-form textarea { font-family: inherit; font-size: 13.5px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18); background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); color: #fff; }
  .demo-form input::placeholder, .demo-form textarea::placeholder { color: #7E8CA3; }
  .demo-form button { font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13.5px; border: none; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 4px; background: var(--orange); color: #fff; }

  footer { padding: 40px 0 56px; }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .fine { font-size: 12px; color: var(--mute); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="wrap bar">
      <div class="brandmark">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 33 72"><path d="M0 36 16.5 0 33 36 16.5 72Z" fill="#F0561E"/></svg>
        Heritage Marketing Studio
      </div>
      <nav class="top">
        <a href="#product">Product</a>
        <a href="#usecases">Use cases</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="hdr-actions">
        <a class="cta-btn" href="#demo">Book a demo</a>
        <a class="signin-link" href="/app">Sign in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>THE FMCG METHOD, WITHOUT THE TWENTY YEARS</div>
        <h1 class="display">One decided idea, carried into everything you make.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A strategy brief becomes a messaging house, becomes an idea platform, becomes
          social posts, POS material, onground activations and film — each one grounded in what was
          actually decided upstream, never a fresh guess.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="cta-btn" href="#demo">Book a demo</a>
          <a class="ghost" href="#product">See how it works ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hv-card hv-video">
          <div class="hv-t">Video studio</div>
          <div class="hv-frames"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hv-card hv-social">
          <div class="hv-top"><div class="hv-dot"></div><div class="hv-line" style="width:70px;"></div></div>
          <div class="hv-body"></div>
          <div class="hv-foot"><div class="hv-line" style="width:60px;"></div><div class="hv-line" style="width:30px;"></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hv-card hv-onground">
          <div class="hv-pin">📍</div>
          <div class="hv-t">Onground activation</div>
          <div class="hv-d">RWA sampling drive — QR scan-to-win</div>
        </div>
        <div class="hv-card hv-pos">
          <div class="hv-tag">POS material</div>
          <svg class="hv-glyph" viewBox="0 0 33 72"><path d="M0 36 16.5 0 33 36 16.5 72Z" fill="#8A4A1E" opacity=".55"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="marquee-wrap">
    <div class="lane left">
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Brief writing — 7 intake formats</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Messaging house — sourced reasons to believe</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Idea platform — tested before it's routed</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>IMC plan — real geography &amp; phasing</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Ground-truth library — signed-off, one home each</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Real approval chain — named, per brand</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Brief writing — 7 intake formats</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Messaging house — sourced reasons to believe</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Idea platform — tested before it's routed</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>IMC plan — real geography &amp; phasing</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Ground-truth library — signed-off, one home each</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Real approval chain — named, per brand</div>
    </div>
    <div class="lane right">
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Social studio — every platform, one idea</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>POS material — one visual, 30+ formats</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Onground — a named capture mechanism</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Video studio — logline to shoot board</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Multi-brand — one company, ten brands</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Full audit trail — every submit and approve</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Social studio — every platform, one idea</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>POS material — one visual, 30+ formats</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Onground — a named capture mechanism</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Video studio — logline to shoot board</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Multi-brand — one company, ten brands</div>
      <div class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Full audit trail — every submit and approve</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="product">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>PRODUCT</div>
        <h2>One decided idea. Five stages. Four producers.</h2>
        <p>Every format the studio produces reads the same brief, the same house, the same plan —
          nothing generated from a blank page, nothing that quietly disagrees with what was decided.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stages">
        <div class="stage"><div class="sn">01</div><div class="st">Brief</div><div class="sd">Seven intake formats, one strategy out</div></div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="sn">02</div><div class="st">Messaging house</div><div class="sd">Eight layers, sourced reasons to believe</div></div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="sn">03</div><div class="st">Idea platform</div><div class="sd">One idea, tested before it's routed</div></div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="sn">04</div><div class="st">IMC plan</div><div class="sd">Phasing, proof, real geography</div></div>
        <div class="stage"><div class="sn">05</div><div class="st">Execution</div><div class="sd">Four producers, one idea each</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="producers-row">
        <div class="producer" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17325E,#2E5EA6);"><div class="pc-t">Social studio</div><div class="pc-d">FB / Instagram / LinkedIn, adapted per platform</div></div>
        <div class="producer" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8A4A1E,#C46A2C);"><div class="pc-t">POS material</div><div class="pc-d">One key visual, 30+ formats re-flowed</div></div>
        <div class="producer" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1E5C4A,#2F8B6F);"><div class="pc-t">Onground</div><div class="pc-d">Venue-aware ideas, a real capture mechanism</div></div>
        <div class="producer" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4A2E5C,#7A4A8F);"><div class="pc-t">Video studio</div><div class="pc-d">Logline to shoot board, ready to film</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="usecases" style="background:var(--card); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>USE CASES</div>
        <h2>How it works, and what comes out the other end</h2>
        <p>Same walkthrough every brand runs — brief, house, idea, plan — then four producers reading
          that plan at once.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-grid">
        <div class="uc-card">
          <div class="uc-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EAF0F8,#DCE7F5);">
            <div style="width:70px;height:88px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;">
              <div style="height:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#17325E,#2E5EA6);"></div>
              <div style="flex:1;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EAF0F8,#fff);"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="uc-meta"><div class="uc-tag" style="color:#2E5EA6;">Social</div><h4>Festival launch, 3 platforms</h4><p>Ganesh Chaturthi launch, adapted per platform from one idea — not three captions saying the same thing once.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-card">
          <div class="uc-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FDEFE6,#FBDFC9);">
            <svg width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 33 72"><path d="M0 36 16.5 0 33 36 16.5 72Z" fill="#8A4A1E" opacity=".5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="uc-meta"><div class="uc-tag" style="color:#8A4A1E;">POS material</div><h4>Shelf-talker + 30 formats</h4><p>One key visual, re-flowed across modern-trade formats, pre-vetted against real substrates.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-card">
          <div class="uc-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#E9F3EF,#D6EBE2); font-size:34px;">📍</div>
          <div class="uc-meta"><div class="uc-tag" style="color:#1E5C4A;">Onground</div><h4>RWA sampling drive</h4><p>Venue-aware idea with a named capture mechanism — QR scan-to-win, not a stunt with nothing to show for it.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="uc-card">
          <div class="uc-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#EFE7F5,#E2D3EF);">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:4px;">
              <span style="width:22px;height:34px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(74,46,92,.28);"></span>
              <span style="width:22px;height:34px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(74,46,92,.4);"></span>
              <span style="width:22px;height:34px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(74,46,92,.28);"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="uc-meta"><div class="uc-tag" style="color:#4A2E5C;">Video</div><h4>Logline → shoot board</h4><p>Concept, script beats and storyboard, through to an approved cut ready to shoot.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="uc-note">Illustrative examples of the shape of output — not real brand campaigns.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>PRICING</div>
        <h2>Priced against what it actually costs to run</h2>
        <p>Brand is already the unit everything in the system is scoped to — houses, plans, platforms,
          media maps. Pricing matches the data model, so it expands without a renegotiation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="price-quote">Per brand, per month. Desks as add-ons. Generation metered.</div>
      <div class="price-grid">
        <div class="price-card"><div class="tier">Studio</div><div class="who">One brand, in-house team</div><div class="amt mono">₹40,000</div><div class="per">per month</div><p class="inc">The spine — brand setup, brief, strategy, plan — plus one producer desk.</p><div class="setup mono">Setup ₹1.5L</div></div>
        <div class="price-card"><div class="tier">Studio Pro</div><div class="who">Up to 3 brands</div><div class="amt mono">₹1,20,000</div><div class="per">per month</div><p class="inc">Spine plus all four desks. Competitive picture and media money included.</p><div class="setup mono">Setup ₹2.5L</div></div>
        <div class="price-card"><div class="tier">Agency</div><div class="who">10+ brands</div><div class="amt mono">₹15–20k</div><div class="per">per brand / month</div><p class="inc">Everything, multi-workspace, per-client isolation.</p><div class="setup mono">Setup ₹3L</div></div>
        <div class="price-card"><div class="tier">Enterprise</div><div class="who">Multi-brand FMCG</div><div class="amt mono">Custom</div><div class="per">&nbsp;</div><p class="inc">SSO, DPA, audit log, security review, dedicated environment.</p><div class="setup mono">Setup — custom</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="price-note">Setup is charged, not discounted — brand setup is genuinely consultative
        (competitive set, geography, languages, category entry points) and it's the strongest predictor
        of retention on file. Video and image generation are metered separately; a text brief is not.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="demo">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="demo-panel">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#A9B7CC;"><span class="dot"></span>BOOK A DEMO</div>
          <h2>See one brand go through the whole spine, live</h2>
          <p class="lede">Thirty minutes — your own brief, or a category we already know — brief to
            messaging house to a finished piece in each of the four producers.</p>
          <div class="demo-q">"When did you last kill a campaign because the numbers didn't support
            it?" — the one question that tells us in advance whether this is a fit.</div>
        </div>
        <form class="demo-form" onsubmit="return false;">
          <label>Name</label><input placeholder="">
          <label>Company</label><input placeholder="">
          <label>Work email</label><input placeholder="" type="email">
          <label>What would you want to see?</label><textarea rows="2"></textarea>
          <button type="submit">Request a walkthrough</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="fine">Heritage Marketing Studio — access to the studio itself is invitation-only.</div>
      <div class="fine">© 2026</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
